claude-gpt (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Claude_Gpt, a Claude-powered cybersecurity assistant for
    the terminal (command: claude-gpt). Ships shell/code/answer generation and the
    recon, web, exploit, blueteam, forensics, osint, ctf and report roles.
  * Native Debian Python package (dh-python/pybuild); runtime dependencies,
    including the Anthropic SDK, come from the distro as python3-* packages.

 -- Étienne Bigant <etienne.bigant@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
